### 🧩 Functional Domains

#### 1. **Tooling Layer** (`tools/`) — 59 Python files, 18.5K LOC
The core of the project. Organized into these categories:

**🧑‍💻 Dev Management:**
- `dev_workspace.py` (1,445L, 40F, 1C) — **Largest file.** Scaffolding, init, install, project CRUD, agent generation
- `dev_generic_init.py` (1,101L, 30F) — Project initialization, symlinks, rules, guidelines, recovery templates
- `dev_template_generator.py` (901L, 19F) — Template filling, agent YAML building, SOT registry management
- `dev_editor.py` (605L, 16F) — YAML patching, backup/rollback, best-practices validation
- `dev_agent_doctor.py` (494L, 19F) — Framework agent scanning, auto-fix, watch mode, lessons application

**🔍 Observability & Monitoring:**
- `dev_observer.py` (432L, 15F, 3C) — File system scanner for YAML/Python agents (3 classes: `FileInfo`, `YamlDetail`, `Scanner`)
- `dev_analyst.py` (312L, 8F) — YAML syntax/size/settings/UTF8/title analysis
- `dev_health_monitor.py` (292L, 6F) — Health checks, runtime monitoring, session logging, recovery
- `dev_goose_db.py` (318L, 13F) — SQLite querying: sessions, costs, models, stale detection
- `dev_dashboard_refresh.py` (412L, 7F) — Dashboard data generation/refresh
- `dev_dashboard_data.py` (325L, 7F) — Dashboard state collection

**🧪 Testing & E2E:**
- `e2e_teams.py` (594L, 7F) — Multi-agent team test orchestration (pty-based)
- `e2e_run_all.py` (327L, 9F) — Full E2E test runner (YAML → top → recovery → interactive)
- `dev_test_runner.py` (184L, 7F) — Test execution framework
- `dev_tff.py` (305L, 7F) — Test-fix-failures pipeline: find → rank → validate (syntax/rule/crossref)

**🔐 Security Scanning:**
- `dev_security_scan.py` (250L, 4F) — Generic security scanner (exclusions, file/scan types)
- Specific scanners in `dev_rule_checker_generic.py` (468L, 16F) and `dev_rule_checker.py` (840L, 6F)

**📄 YAML Tooling:**
- `dev_yaml_check.py` (351L, 9F) — YAML/python/shell syntax validation
- `dev_yaml_immune.py` (250L, 6F) — YAML roundtrip, path resolution, required fields
- `dev_yaml_generator.py` / `dev_yaml_generator_core.py` / `dev_yaml_generator_generic.py`

**⚡ Parallel & Dispatch:**
- `dev_parallel.py` (425L, 17F, 1C) — Multi-agent parallel dispatch using `ParalllPool` class (legacy + modern modes)

**📈 Session & IM Pipeline:**
- `dev_session_query.py` (512L, 15F) — Goose SQLite session queries, pattern extraction, metrics
- `dev_im_finder_scan.py` (611L, 3F) — IM pipeline scanning with findings categorization

**🔧 Pre-Check Library** (`tools/pre_check_lib/`):
- `auto_repair.py` (203L, 7F) — Workflow auto-repair, placeholder/restore checks (function `_get_auto_repair_step` called 5×)
- `german.py` (115L, 3F) — German descriptions/placeholder checks
- `phoenix.py` (169L, 5F) — Recovery workflow checks (function `_check_recovery_workflow` called 4×)

